[{:db/id 17592186133822 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-9375f3f0-3aa6-5a84-b715-8086fa3c68db"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-9375f3f0-3aa6-5a84-b715-8086fa3c68db" :question/id #uuid "9375f3f0-3aa6-5a84-b715-8086fa3c68db" :question/math-academy-id "q-136883" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=1 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3}=-1\\end{aligned}\\,\\,[\\begin{aligned}5 & -10 & 5 \\\\ -10 & a & b \\\\ 5 & -10 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ c \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear equations and its corresponding normal equation shown above. What is the value of $a+b+c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write our system in matrix form as $Ax=b,$ where \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe normal equation corresponding to $Ax=b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{T}\\,Ax & ={A}^{T}b \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}5 & -10 & 5 \\\\ -10 & 20 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -10 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=20+(-10)+(-6)=4.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-78b40939-3724-59f7-a9d3-46896f75c235"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-78b40939-3724-59f7-a9d3-46896f75c235" :answer-field/id #uuid "78b40939-3724-59f7-a9d3-46896f75c235" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-95715e13-7ac3-5517-874f-49e84cbcd24f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2b3bc517-738d-5126-88d0-bb939758899a" "answer-95715e13-7ac3-5517-874f-49e84cbcd24f" "answer-65d7077d-9a54-50ce-b898-454bc4952add" "answer-299f4294-b751-5683-b5f0-226953e8f833" "answer-1053e502-fa88-53f4-be0b-479818f8c240"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2b3bc517-738d-5126-88d0-bb939758899a" :answer/id #uuid "2b3bc517-738d-5126-88d0-bb939758899a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95715e13-7ac3-5517-874f-49e84cbcd24f" :answer/id #uuid "95715e13-7ac3-5517-874f-49e84cbcd24f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65d7077d-9a54-50ce-b898-454bc4952add" :answer/id #uuid "65d7077d-9a54-50ce-b898-454bc4952add" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-299f4294-b751-5683-b5f0-226953e8f833" :answer/id #uuid "299f4294-b751-5683-b5f0-226953e8f833" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1053e502-fa88-53f4-be0b-479818f8c240" :answer/id #uuid "1053e502-fa88-53f4-be0b-479818f8c240" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186415142 :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}=-1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-6{x}_{2}=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear equations shown above. If the general least-squares solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}b \\\\ c\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $14a+\\frac{b}{c}?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186269138 :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}=4 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear equations shown above. If the general least-squares solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}b \\\\ c\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $4a+\\frac{b}{c}?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-2d949d07-51ef-507a-9e46-8bf1f67d9df7" :activity/id #uuid "2d949d07-51ef-507a-9e46-8bf1f67d9df7" :activity/title "The Least-Squares Solution of a Linear System (With Collinearity)" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049557 :activity/course 17592186046660 :activity/steps ["step-a1688a74-897d-5afb-9f94-e25cf31e0ff7" "step-473601d5-d5b9-5c59-bd36-f1929c8ba75a" "step-fa437fa9-8308-5fcb-8e51-f5209d6b878f" "step-e8883930-b72c-578f-b1d0-c991d93f6689" "step-dc1e81e2-a33c-5ae5-b25d-0e3fcbe639b8"] :activity/first-step "step-a1688a74-897d-5afb-9f94-e25cf31e0ff7" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-a1688a74-897d-5afb-9f94-e25cf31e0ff7" :step/id #uuid "a1688a74-897d-5afb-9f94-e25cf31e0ff7" :step/content "question-9375f3f0-3aa6-5a84-b715-8086fa3c68db" :step/next "step-473601d5-d5b9-5c59-bd36-f1929c8ba75a" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-473601d5-d5b9-5c59-bd36-f1929c8ba75a" :step/id #uuid "473601d5-d5b9-5c59-bd36-f1929c8ba75a" :step/content 17592186415143 :step/next "step-fa437fa9-8308-5fcb-8e51-f5209d6b878f" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-fa437fa9-8308-5fcb-8e51-f5209d6b878f" :step/id #uuid "fa437fa9-8308-5fcb-8e51-f5209d6b878f" :step/content 17592186367436 :step/next "step-e8883930-b72c-578f-b1d0-c991d93f6689" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-e8883930-b72c-578f-b1d0-c991d93f6689" :step/id #uuid "e8883930-b72c-578f-b1d0-c991d93f6689" :step/content 17592186415142 :step/next "step-dc1e81e2-a33c-5ae5-b25d-0e3fcbe639b8" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-dc1e81e2-a33c-5ae5-b25d-0e3fcbe639b8" :step/id #uuid "dc1e81e2-a33c-5ae5-b25d-0e3fcbe639b8" :step/content 17592186269138 :db/ensure [:step/valid